Query:
--Description: 7) Join the winner & loser IDs from that match to the Wrestlers table to get their names
SELECT w1.name AS wrestler_1, 
       w2.name AS wrestler_2
FROM Matches  m
JOIN Wrestlers w1 ON w1.id = m.winner_id
JOIN Wrestlers w2 ON w2.id = m.loser_id
WHERE m.id = (
        SELECT id
        FROM Matches
        WHERE title_id IN (SELECT id FROM Belts WHERE name LIKE '%NXT%')
          AND title_change = 0
          AND duration = (SELECT MIN(duration)
                          FROM Matches
                          WHERE title_id IN (SELECT id FROM Belts WHERE name LIKE '%NXT%')
                            AND title_change = 0
                            AND duration <> '')
        LIMIT 1)
;
Answer:
wrestler_1,wrestler_2
Bron Breakker,Duke Hudson
